     "body": "<p>I've updated <a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/pull/763\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/pull/763</a></p>\n\n<p>It still uses node path munging to identify events about the same node and collapse them, but it now uses the (superior) logic in FedoraEvent instead of a regex.  I've also included an IT demonstrating that only a single event is emitted when a content node is added.</p>",
